<% content_for :title, 'Unsubscribed - Cope Notes' %>
<h1 role="status">You are unsubscribed</h1>
<p>
  We will not send any more notes to
  <strong><%= masked_email(@subscriber.email) %></strong>.
</p>
<p class="quiet">
  Thank you for letting us keep you company for a while. If things feel heavy
  right now, please reach out to someone you trust or a local support line.
</p>
